# Netlify headers. These apply ONLY to Netlify deploy previews.
# Production is served by GitHub Pages, which ignores this file.
# The Content Security Policy lives in layouts/partials/extend-head.html
# as a <meta> tag so that it applies on both hosts.
#
# Caching is left to Netlify's defaults (ETag revalidation), which is
# what you want for previews that change on every push.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
